    "[C]Since Jesus came to [D]seek and save the [G]lost.",
    "",
    "[G]Give me the Bible, holy message [C]shining;",
    "[G]Thy light shall guide me in the [A]narrow [D]way;",
    "[G]Precept and promise, [D]law and love [G]combining,",
    "[C]Till night shall vanish [D]in eternal [G]day.",
    "",
    "Give me the Bible",
    "when my heart is broken,",
    "When sin and grief have",
    "filled my soul with fear,",
    "Give me the precious",
    "words by Jesus spoken,",
    "Hold up faith's lamp",
    "to show my Savior near.",
    "",
    "Give me the Bible,",
    "all my steps enlighten,",
    "Teach me the danger",
    "of these realms below,",
    "That lamp of safety,",
    "o'er the gloom shall brighten,",
    "That light alone",
    "the path of peace can show."
